NNOOTTEESS
     The conductor questions are only meaningful on a sheet that
     draws CIRCUITS.  A diagram sheet - flowchart, floor plan,
     structure chart - uses stencils whose pins are attachment
     points, not terminals; this program will still walk it, but
     vveellcchheecckk deliberately does not judge it.
